          "type": "UObject*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "void*",
      "docs": "Get the specified data for the specified instance. The data may or may not reside on an anim instance itself as it may have been folded into constants.\n@param\tInId\t\t\t\tThe data ID to use\n@param\tInNode\t\t\t\tThe anim node that this data is for\n@param\tInCurrentObject\t\tThe object that the node is held on. This is optional as it can be recovered via the node where needed, but can accelerate the operation if supplied.\n@return the raw data value, either held on sparse class data or on the instance"
    },
